# Purpose
Machine-readable public index for user-facing manuals and videos.

# Key Sections
- How to use the catalogue.
- Topic index.
- Starter paths by user intent.
- Credential, connector, status, and turn-management routing.
- Video catalogue reference.

# Dependencies
- `videos/index.json` for structured video metadata.
- Top-level help folders for linked documentation.

# Gotchas
- Do not include private implementation docs or internal-only source paths.
- Keep links relative so the catalogue works locally on a seeded node.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Added routing for AI agent credentials, GitHub credentials,
  templates, status bar, and turn management.
- 2026-08-03: Created initial public catalogue for the new help spine.
